From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] deepseek-v4.1: MXFP4 MoE prefill split-list and 64-head sparse prefill

Default off. VLLM_DSV41_MOE_PREFILL_SPLIT: MXFP4 MoE prefill routes each
4096-token chunk through split expert lists (27.4 -> 23.0 ms per chunk;
fp64 error at Marlin's level). VLLM_DSV41_SPARSE_PREFILL_64H: 64-head tile for
sparse MLA prefill (bitwise); no stable engine gain, not enabled.

